{
	"name": "Soul of Magic",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/light/explosion-star-glow-silhouette.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Your level of dedication to mastering your magic rivals that of any wizard. You have refined the power that comes from within you into a potent instrument of your will. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Your Constitution, Intelligence, or Charisma score increases by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>You gain an expertise die to your Arcana skill. Your maximum expertise die size for Arcana increases to a d12.</p></li><li><p>You learn a 3rd- or 4th- level spell from the bard, sorcerer, or wizard list. It counts as a sorcerer spell for you, and does not count against your spells known.</p></li><li><p>You gain an additional @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.q162ah61o4pgc1dd]{Moderate Metamagic} option. It does not count against your Moderate Metamagic options known.</p></li></ul><p>Once you have selected this feat, you can no longer gain levels in classes other than sorcerer.</p>",
